# Context filter for `docker build -f cav26ae/Dockerfile ..`, read by BuildKit in
# preference to the repository's root `.dockerignore`, which it REPLACES rather
# than extends -- so this file repeats the root's entries and leaves out only
# `cav26ae` itself.  Without it, the root file removes `cav26ae` from the context and the
# image is built without the experiment scripts this package's README tells the
# reader to run; the build succeeds anyway, which is how that went unnoticed for
# a year.  Requires BuildKit (the default since Docker 23.0); under the classic
# builder the root file applies instead and the package is broken again.

.git
_build
.vscode

cav21ae_dt
cav21ae_rel
popl24ae
icfp24ae
oopsla25ae
pldi26ae_lower
pldi26ae_omega
script/starexec
learner
script
